---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { path } from '../i18n/routes';
---

<BaseLayout lang="nl" page="abstracts" title="Abstracts en posters">
<section class="night" style="position:relative;padding-top:clamp(80px,10vw,144px);overflow:hidden"><img class="hero-media" src="/assets/slaap-sprekers_foto38.jpg" alt="" width="1920" height="1280"><div class="shade-side" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wrap" style="position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;padding-bottom:clamp(64px,8vw,104px)"><h1 style="font-size:clamp(40px,5.6vw,72px);font-weight:800;color:#FFFFFF;max-width:920px">Presenteer je onderzoek op SLAAP2027</h1><p class="lead" style="color:#C9CDE3;max-width:760px">We verwelkomen bijdragen uit alle gebieden van de slaapgeneeskunde en het slaaponderzoek: als abstract voor een poster, of als voorstel voor een symposium.</p><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:8px"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#">Abstract indienen</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#">Symposium voorstellen</a></div><nav aria-label="Op deze pagina" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:8px"><a class="chip" href="#richtlijnen">Richtlijnen</a><a class="chip" href="#posters">Posters</a><a class="chip" href="#data-blitz">Data Blitz</a><a class="chip" href="#prijzen">Posterprijzen</a></nav></div></section><section style="background:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:1px solid #DADDE8"><div class="wrap grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(260px,100%),1fr));gap:0 32px;padding-top:28px;padding-bottom:28px"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;padding:26px 24px 26px 0;border-top:3px solid #E8352B"><span class="muted" style="font-weight:600;font-size:16px">Deadline abstracts</span><span class="disp" style="font-size:26px;font-weight:700"><em class="ph">[datum]</em></span></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;padding:26px 24px 26px 0;border-top:3px solid #E8352B"><span class="muted" style="font-weight:600;font-size:16px">Deadline symposiumvoorstellen</span><span class="disp" style="font-size:26px;font-weight:700"><em class="ph">[datum]</em></span></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;padding:26px 24px 26px 0;border-top:3px solid #E8352B"><span class="muted" style="font-weight:600;font-size:16px">Bericht over acceptatie</span><span class="disp" style="font-size:26px;font-weight:700"><em class="ph">[datum]</em></span></div></div></section><section id="richtlijnen" class="sec" style="scroll-margin-top:24px"><div class="wrap grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(420px,100%),1fr));gap:clamp(40px,6vw,88px);align-items:start"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px"><h2 class="h2">Richtlijnen voor abstracts</h2><ul class="rule-list" style="list-style:none"><li><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Je dient je abstract in het Engels in.</span></li><li><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Je mag meerdere abstracts indienen.</span></li><li><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Een abstract telt maximaal 300 woorden.</span></li><li><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Gebruik de vaste opbouw: Title, Background, Methods, Results en Conclusion.</span></li><li><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Na acceptatie registreert de presenterende auteur zich als reguliere deelnemer.</span></li></ul><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px"><a class="btn btn-dark" href="#">Abstract indienen</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="#"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v11M7 10l5 5 5-5M5 20h14"></path></svg>Voorwaarden (PDF)</a></div></div><div class="panel" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><h3 class="h3">Opbouw van je abstract</h3><ol style="list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:#F3F4F9"><span class="tabular" style="flex:0 0 28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:#12152A;color:#6EC3EE;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">1</span><span lang="en" style="font-weight:700">Title</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:#F3F4F9"><span class="tabular" style="flex:0 0 28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:#12152A;color:#6EC3EE;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">2</span><span lang="en" style="font-weight:700">Background</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:#F3F4F9"><span class="tabular" style="flex:0 0 28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:#12152A;color:#6EC3EE;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">3</span><span lang="en" style="font-weight:700">Methods</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:#F3F4F9"><span class="tabular" style="flex:0 0 28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:#12152A;color:#6EC3EE;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">4</span><span lang="en" style="font-weight:700">Results</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:#F3F4F9"><span class="tabular" style="flex:0 0 28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:#12152A;color:#6EC3EE;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">5</span><span lang="en" style="font-weight:700">Conclusion</span></li></ol><p class="muted" style="font-size:16px">Samen maximaal 300 woorden.</p><div style="height:1px;background:#E6E8F0;margin:6px 0"></div><h3 class="h3">Een symposium organiseren?</h3><p class="muted">Stel een symposium samen met sprekers uit jouw vakgebied en dien het voorstel in via het abstractplatform, uiterlijk <em class="ph">[datum]</em>.</p></div></div></section><section id="posters" class="sec" style="background:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #DADDE8;scroll-margin-top:24px"><div class="wrap" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:32px"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:820px"><h2 class="h2">Informatie voor posterpresentatoren</h2><p class="lead muted" style="max-width:760px">Alle geaccepteerde abstracts worden als poster gepresenteerd in de <em class="ph">[zaal]</em>.</p></div><figure style="margin:0;height:clamp(240px,32vw,440px)"><img class="photo" src="/assets/slaap-posters_foto199.jpg" alt="Deelnemers in gesprek bij de posters op SLAAP2025" loading="lazy"></figure><div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(260px,100%),1fr))"><div class="panel" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><h3 class="h3">Formaat</h3><p class="muted">A0, staand (841 &#215; 1189 mm).</p></div><div class="panel" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><h3 class="h3">Ophangen</h3><p class="muted"><em class="ph">[dag en datum]</em> vanaf <em class="ph">[tijd]</em>, of <em class="ph">[dag]</em> vóór <em class="ph">[tijd]</em> op je toegewezen posterbord. Bevestigingsmateriaal ligt klaar.</p></div><div class="panel" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><h3 class="h3">Verwijderen</h3><p class="muted">Uiterlijk <em class="ph">[dag]</em> om <em class="ph">[tijd]</em>. Posters die blijven hangen, worden door de organisatie verwijderd.</p></div><div class="panel" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><h3 class="h3">Posterreceptie</h3><p class="muted"><em class="ph">[dag]</em> van <em class="ph">[tijd]</em> tot <em class="ph">[tijd]</em>. Tijdens de receptie en de lunchpauzes sta je bij je poster om je werk toe te lichten.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="data-blitz" class="sec night" style="scroll-margin-top:24px"><div class="wrap grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(420px,100%),1fr));gap:clamp(40px,6vw,88px);align-items:center"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><h2 class="h2" style="color:#FFFFFF">Data Blitz</h2><p class="lead" style="color:#C9CDE3">Pitch je poster in één minuut voor de hele zaal en trek bezoekers naar je posterbord.</p><p class="soft">Bereid je voor met de pitchworkshop van de NSWO Early Career Scientists op <em class="ph">[datum en locatie]</em>.</p></div><div class="panel-night grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px"><span class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(36px,4vw,52px);font-weight:800;line-height:1;color:#FFFFFF">1</span><span class="soft" style="font-size:16px">minuut pitch</span></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px"><span class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(36px,4vw,52px);font-weight:800;line-height:1;color:#FFFFFF">1</span><span class="soft" style="font-size:16px">slide, 16:9</span></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px"><span class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(36px,4vw,52px);font-weight:800;line-height:1;color:#FFFFFF">EN</span><span class="soft" style="font-size:16px">voertaal</span></div></div></div></section><section id="prijzen" class="sec" style="scroll-margin-top:24px"><div class="wrap" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:32px"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:820px"><h2 class="h2">Posterprijzen</h2><p class="lead muted" style="max-width:760px">De prijzen worden uitgereikt op <em class="ph">[dag]</em> om <em class="ph">[tijd]</em>.</p></div><div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(300px,100%),1fr))"><div class="panel" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><h3 class="h3">Publieksprijs</h3><p class="muted">Voor de poster met de meeste stemmen van congresdeelnemers.</p></div><div class="panel" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border:2px solid #12152A"><h3 class="h3">Piet Visser Posterprijs</h3><p class="muted">Toegekend door een vakjury: een wisseltrofee en &#8364; 500, aangeboden door NSWO en SVNL.</p><p style="font-weight:600">Alleen leden van NSWO of SVNL komen in aanmerking. <a href={path('nl', 'registratie', 'lid-worden')}>Lid worden</a></p></div><figure style="margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><div style="height:clamp(220px,22vw,300px)"><img class="photo" src="/assets/slaap-awards_foto331.jpg" alt="Uitreiking van de Piet Visser Posterprijs op SLAAP2025" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption class="muted" style="font-size:15px">Uitreiking van de Piet Visser Posterprijs op SLAAP2025</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
